  "scope": "Complete Proposition 4.16 for the actual FrequentPatternResult on an arbitrary finite index type of cardinality three or four, and complete Theorem 4.17 for the original even-order simple regular host with three or four robust cores. Uniform choices precede the host and all graph-dependent data. The all-even and exactly-two-odd four-core branches join the existing three-core and all-four-odd cases. Actual original edge copies, forest and pair supplies, and the literal linear exceptional/core-error budget are preserved. The main theorem remains unverified. The inventory describes current sources; the new full kernel run and preservation receipt establish verification.",
